#: ../../tools/ena_portal_tools.rst:32 becd78e3539b47c0a91c8dd33c9b4caf
msgid ""
"**Description**: Count the number of records matching a query in the "
"European Nucleotide Archive (ENA). Supports counting studies, samples, "
"reads, and other result types. Useful for estimating dataset sizes before"
" downloading. Example: counting studies with "
"'description=\"transcriptomics\"' returns ~9,000+, showing the breadth of"
" transcriptomics data in ENA."
msgstr ""

