"default 10)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../tools/ena_portal_tools.rst:76 c97c4a892c884a639acb3d115e864d8a
msgid ""
"``fields`` (string, null) (optional) Comma-separated fields. Default: "
"'sample\\_accession,sample\\_alias,description,tax\\_id,scientific\\_name,first\\_public'."
msgstr ""

